{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたい映画がたくさんある！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは最近の映画みましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、映画館での映画は\n貞子vs伽倻子からみてない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DVDになるまで待つしかないかな～。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、小説を読んで\n勉強しておきます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/20/8164250/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/20/8164250/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/20/8164250/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読書の秋も食欲の秋も\nすごく共感できる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小説は意識的に読んでるけど\nちゃんと続けて読めてるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暇さえあればずっと食べ物たべてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これこそ！食欲の秋と読書の秋！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、スポーツの秋が。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったくだ。。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動かないで小説読みながら\n食べ物ばっかり食べてたら。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし